## Bug description

The bundled `skills/autonomous-ai-agents/hermes-agent` skill has drifted from the current CLI, runtime code, and official documentation.

Several stale claims are security-sensitive or profile-unsafe. They can lead the agent to:

- place credentials in `config.yaml`;
- bypass the supported MCP setup flow;
- resolve state from the wrong profile in multiplexed processes;
- misdiagnose project context loading;
- misunderstand approval protections;
- use process-local background ...
